[
  {
    "start": 0.35,
    "end": 2.2875,
    "text": "You spent hours tracking dinner."
  },
  {
    "start": 2.2875,
    "end": 3.6375,
    "text": "Dinner ran away."
  },
  {
    "start": 3.6375,
    "end": 6.1375,
    "text": "So, does your prehistoric camp go hungry?"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.1375,
    "end": 7.675,
    "text": "Not necessarily."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.425,
    "end": 11.1125,
    "text": "Hunting was only part of the food story."
  },
  {
    "start": 11.1125,
    "end": 13.537500000000001,
    "text": "Depending on the place and season, people"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.537500000000001,
    "end": 15.725000000000001,
    "text": "also gathered edible plants and caught"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.725000000000001,
    "end": 17.275,
    "text": "smaller animals."
  },
  {
    "start": 18.05,
    "end": 19.6125,
    "text": "Knowing where to look mattered."
  },
  {
    "start": 19.6125,
    "end": 21.775,
    "text": "So did knowing what not to eat."
  },
  {
    "start": 22.55,
    "end": 24.35,
    "text": "Meanwhile, other people were gathering"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.35,
    "end": 26.9125,
    "text": "fuel, preparing food, and maintaining"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.9125,
    "end": 27.9,
    "text": "tools."
  },
  {
    "start": 28.650000000000002,
    "end": 31.1,
    "text": "Your failed hunt was one part of the day,"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.1,
    "end": 34.1375,
    "text": "not everyone's entire survival plan."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.1375,
    "end": 36.4625,
    "text": "Sharing work and resources helped people"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.4625,
    "end": 38.25,
    "text": "handle uncertainty."
  },
  {
    "start": 38.975,
    "end": 41.0,
    "text": "Tonight's meal might be modest."
  },
  {
    "start": 41.0,
    "end": 42.949999999999996,
    "text": "But at least nobody asks why you didn't"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.949999999999996,
    "end": 44.65,
    "text": "just order delivery."
  }
]